  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society  Project Funding &amp; Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Civil Society Fund (CSF) provides support to NGOs to carry out development projects of between one and three years&#x2019; duration. It is primarily intended for Irish development NGOs but a limited number of international NGOs are invited to apply on the basis of identified policy gaps.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Civil Society Fund is a competitive project funding scheme primarily for Irish NGOs to carry out development projects overseas</narrative>
  </description>
